@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* Deliberately makes zero API calls (unlike KioskLayout, which fetches branch branding in its
   own OnInitializedAsync) — for pages reachable by an authenticated-but-gated user (e.g.
   AccountStatus.razor), any authenticated call KioskLayout made on their behalf would itself hit
   the same tenant-status 403 and re-trigger TenantStatusMessageHandler's redirect mid-render,
   corrupting the very page meant to explain the gate. A system status page doesn't need
   per-tenant branding anyway. *@
@Body
